### DevDesk AI API requests
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Load policy documents
POST {{host}}/api/ingest

### Ask a policy question
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "VPN 승인에는 얼마나 걸려?",
  "sessionId": "policy-demo",
  "userId": "user1"
}

### Check the current user's access
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "내 DEV_DB 권한 상태 알려줘.",
  "sessionId": "access-demo",
  "userId": "user1"
}

### Create a pending support ticket
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "PROD_DB 권한을 신청해줘. 운영 지원에 필요해.",
  "sessionId": "ticket-demo",
  "userId": "user1"
}

### Inspect conversation history
GET {{host}}/api/history?sessionId=access-demo&userId=user1

### Inspect pending tickets
GET {{host}}/api/admin/tickets

### Application metrics
GET {{host}}/api/metrics

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus
